# What is deliberately NOT in the repository.
#
# `il/client-5.8.2.il` is 85 MB of dumped game IL.  It is evidence -- `il_index.py`
# cross-checks every pinned target against it, and the README says so -- but it is derived
# from the shipped assembly rather than written by this project, the same category as the
# decompiled tree the documents cite under `work/decomp`, and it is not versioned here.
# Both are reproducible with the tooling in `tools/` and a copy of the installed build;
# see docs/HOOK-BUILD-MATRIX.md for the procedure.
il/

# Python bytecode from the tools in this directory.
tools/__pycache__/
